#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Corollary]
// #title[Title]

Let $A$ and $B$ be $pi_0$- and $pi_1$-finite 1-types. Then $A + B$ is $pi_0$- and $pi_1$-finite and $|A + B| + |A| + |B|$.

#proof[
  Consider the type family $C : bb(2) -> Uu, C(0) :-= A, C(1) :-= C$. Then apply 
  #local("00EU")[Lemma 00EU] to the type $sum_(b : bb(2)) C(b) -= A + B$.
]
